    "body": "Hi,\n\nThe data splitting is intended for your internal experimenting purposes. After generating embeddings using the split data, you can proceed with training, but be sure to include the `--disable-relevant-clients-check flag`. This flag disables a specific validator check.\n\nIf you're looking to create baseline embeddings that comply with the competition format and can be submitted, follow these steps:\n1. Create a directory named `ubc_data_submission` with two subdirectories: `input` and `target`.\n2. Copy the following unsplit data files into `ubc_data_submission/input`:\n \n```\nubc_data/product_buy.parquet\nubc_data/remove_from_cart.parquet\nubc_data/add_to_cart.parquet\nubc_data/page_visit.parquet\nubc_data/search_query.parquet\n```\n3. Also copy `ubc_data/input/relevant_clients.npy` to `ubc_data_submission/input`.\n4. Copy `ubc_data/product_properties.parquet` to `ubc_data_submission` (not the input folder).\n5. Once the directory is prepared, run:\n`python -m baseline.aggregated_features_baseline.create_embeddings --data-dir ubc_data_submission --embeddings-dir embeddings`\n\nAfter that, both of the following validator commands should pass:\n`python -m validator.run --data-dir ubc_data --embeddings-dir embeddings`\nand\n`python -m validator.run --data-dir ubc_data_submission --embeddings-dir embeddings`",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
